## Context and authorship

Developed by **Mohamed Ikbal EL AGADI** during an internship at **BHS Engineering**, in the context of spatially distributed hydrological–hydraulic modelling for the **Tensift basin**, with a pilot application to **Chichaoua, Morocco**.

